WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.033
Ready

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:04.067
Move to pregrasp

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:09.033
Approach the housing

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:12.800
Stabilize the housing

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.833
Approach the key

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:21.567
Grasp the key

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:29.033
Lift the key

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:49.033
Transfer the key

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:52.800
Orient the key

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:59.067
Lower the key

00:00:59.067 --> 00:00:59.200
Align the key with the housing

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:20.400
Insert the key

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.900
Release the key

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:26.667
Withdraw the right hand

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:29.133
Release the housing

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:32.900
Withdraw the left hand

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.933
Observe the released assembly

